---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const repoUrl = "https://github.com/cardene777/dragon";
---

<footer class="v4-foot">
  <div class="v4-foot-brand">
    <a href="/" class="v4-nav-brand" style="margin-right:0;">
      <div class="v4-nav-mark">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 28 28" fill="none">
          <path d="M4 24 L24 4 L24 24 Z" fill="#1a1f2a" />
          <path d="M4 24 L14 14 L24 24 Z" fill="#2d6a8f" opacity="0.85" />
        </svg>
      </div>
      <span class="v4-nav-name">dragon</span>
    </a>
    <p>Text DSL × SVG animation の OSS。 mermaid 感覚で書ける、 動く図のためのツール。</p>
    <p class="v4-foot-copy">© {year} cardenelabs · MIT</p>
  </div>
  <div class="v4-foot-col">
    <h4>project</h4>
    <a href="/">overview</a>
    <a href={`${repoUrl}/releases`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">changelog</a>
    <a href={`${repoUrl}/issues`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">roadmap</a>
    <a href={repoUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">github ↗</a>
  </div>
  <div class="v4-foot-col">
    <h4>learn</h4>
    <a href="/docs">docs</a>
    <a href="/catalog">catalog</a>
    <a href="/editor">editor</a>
    <a href={`${repoUrl}#readme`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">readme</a>
  </div>
  <div class="v4-foot-col">
    <h4>community</h4>
    <a href={`${repoUrl}/discussions`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">discussions</a>
    <a href={`${repoUrl}/issues/new`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">report issue</a>
    <a href={`${repoUrl}/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md`} target="_blank" rel="noopener">contribute</a>
  </div>
</footer>

<style is:global>
  .v4-foot {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--v4-line);
    padding: 40px 32px;
    max-width: 1180px;
    margin: 56px auto 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 32px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: var(--v4-sans);
    color: var(--v4-ink-dim);
  }
  .v4-foot-brand .v4-nav-name {
    font-size: 18px;
  }
  .v4-foot-brand p {
    color: var(--v4-ink-dim);
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    max-width: 280px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  .v4-foot-copy {
    color: var(--v4-ink-mute);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-family: var(--v4-mono);
    margin-top: 8px !important;
  }
  .v4-foot-col h4 {
    font-family: var(--v4-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--v4-ink-mute);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .v4-foot-col a {
    display: block;
    color: var(--v4-ink-dim);
    padding: 3px 0;
    font-size: 13px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.15s;
  }
  .v4-foot-col a:hover {
    color: var(--v4-ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .v4-foot {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
